msgctxt "#32218"
msgid "The Trakt add-on is also enabled. Both add-ons scrobble and sync with Trakt, so everything is done twice."
msgstr "Add-on Trakt juga diaktifkan. Kedua add-on melakukan scrobble dan sinkronisasi dengan Trakt, sehingga semuanya dilakukan dua kali."

msgctxt "#32219"
msgid "Keep both"
msgstr "Pertahankan keduanya"

msgctxt "#32220"
msgid "Start rewatch"
msgstr "Mulai tonton ulang"

msgctxt "#32221"
msgid "Start a rewatch on Trakt? Your progress starts again, and every episode is marked unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Mulai tonton ulang di Trakt? Progres Anda dimulai lagi dari awal, dan semua episode ditandai belum ditonton di Kodi."

msgctxt "#32222"
msgid "Rewatch started"
msgstr "Tonton ulang dimulai"

msgctxt "#32223"
msgid "Couldn't start rewatch"
msgstr "Gagal memulai tonton ulang"

msgctxt "#32224"
msgid "Use the OG Trakt theme"
msgstr "Gunakan tema OG Trakt"

msgctxt "#32225"
msgid "Shows Trakt's red logo, hearts and highlights, as on og.trakt.tv."
msgstr "Menampilkan logo merah Trakt, ikon hati, dan warna sorotan, seperti di og.trakt.tv."

msgctxt "#32226"
msgid "%i couldn't be synced"
msgstr "%i gagal disinkronkan"

msgctxt "#32227"
msgid "Your Trakt account is locked. Contact Trakt support."
msgstr "Akun Trakt Anda dikunci. Hubungi dukungan Trakt."

msgctxt "#32228"
msgid "Watchlist limit of %i reached"
msgstr "Batas daftar tonton %i tercapai"

msgctxt "#32229"
msgid "Choose what to sync"
msgstr "Pilih yang akan disinkronkan"

msgctxt "#32230"
msgid "Open the sync setup shown after connecting to Trakt."
msgstr "Buka pengaturan sinkronisasi yang ditampilkan setelah terhubung ke Trakt."

msgctxt "#32231"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean. Otherwise a sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Sinkronkan saat Kodi selesai memindai atau membersihkan pustaka. Jika tidak, sinkronisasi hanya berjalan saat Anda memulainya, misalnya dari menu konteks."

msgctxt "#32232"
msgid "Notify when a sync after a library scan or clean starts and finishes."
msgstr "Beri notifikasi saat sinkronisasi setelah pemindaian atau pembersihan pustaka dimulai dan selesai."

msgctxt "#32233"
msgid "Show no sync notifications while a video plays."
msgstr "Jangan tampilkan notifikasi sinkronisasi saat video diputar."

msgctxt "#32234"
msgid "Match items without an IMDb, TMDB or TVDB id by title and year, when scrobbling and syncing. Never used to unwatch items or clear ratings."
msgstr "Cocokkan item tanpa ID IMDb, TMDB, atau TVDB berdasarkan judul dan tahun, saat scrobbling dan sinkronisasi. Tidak pernah digunakan untuk menandai item belum ditonton atau menghapus rating."

msgctxt "#32235"
msgid "Watched status"
msgstr "Status tonton"

msgctxt "#32236"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included, and anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched. Kodi to Trakt: items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Both ways: each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Trakt ke Kodi: Kodi mengikuti Trakt, termasuk jumlah pemutaran dan tanggal, dan apa pun yang tidak memiliki pemutaran di Trakt ditandai belum ditonton. Kodi ke Trakt: item yang ditonton di Kodi tanpa pemutaran di Trakt ditambahkan ke riwayatnya. Dua arah: setiap sisi mendapatkan pemutaran yang belum dimilikinya, dan tidak ada yang ditandai belum ditonton di luar tonton ulang Trakt."

msgctxt "#32237"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Nonaktif"

msgctxt "#32238"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi"
msgstr "Trakt ke Kodi"

msgctxt "#32239"
msgid "Kodi to Trakt"
msgstr "Kodi ke Trakt"

msgctxt "#32240"
msgid "Both ways"
msgstr "Dua arah"

msgctxt "#32241"
msgid "Ratings"
msgstr "Rating"

msgctxt "#32242"
msgid "Movies, shows and episodes"
msgstr "Film, acara, dan episode"

msgctxt "#32243"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi. Kodi to Trakt: Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Both ways: missing ratings are copied each way, and where they differ Trakt's is kept."
msgstr "Trakt ke Kodi: Kodi mengikuti Trakt, dan rating yang tidak ada di Trakt dihapus di Kodi. Kodi ke Trakt: rating Kodi ditambahkan ke Trakt, menggantikan rating yang berbeda. Dua arah: rating yang hilang disalin ke kedua arah, dan jika berbeda, rating Trakt dipertahankan."

msgctxt "#32244"
msgid "Resume points from Trakt"
msgstr "Titik lanjut dari Trakt"

msgctxt "#32245"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device. Playback in Kodi still sends its progress to Trakt when this is off."
msgstr "Kodi melanjutkan dari posisi item dijeda di Trakt, misalnya dari perangkat lain. Pemutaran di Kodi tetap mengirim progresnya ke Trakt saat opsi ini nonaktif."

msgctxt "#32246"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Tambah"

msgctxt "#32247"
msgid "Add and remove"
msgstr "Tambah dan buang"

msgctxt "#32248"
msgid "Add: Kodi's items are added to the Trakt collection. Add and remove: collected items Kodi doesn't have are removed from it too, including ones from other devices or apps."
msgstr "Tambah: item Kodi ditambahkan ke koleksi Trakt. Tambah dan buang: item koleksi yang tidak ada di Kodi juga dibuang dari koleksi, termasuk yang berasal dari perangkat atau aplikasi lain."

msgctxt "#32249"
msgid "Relay always scrobbles when connected. Sync handles what it didn't scrobble: other devices, older history."
msgstr "Relay selalu melakukan scrobble saat terhubung. Sinkronisasi menangani yang tidak di-scrobble: perangkat lain, riwayat lama."

msgctxt "#32250"
msgid "On"
msgstr "Aktif"

msgctxt "#32251"
msgid "Watched status isn't synced."
msgstr "Status tonton tidak disinkronkan."

msgctxt "#32252"
msgid "Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included. Anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Kodi mengikuti Trakt, termasuk jumlah pemutaran dan tanggal. Apa pun yang tidak memiliki pemutaran di Trakt ditandai belum ditonton di Kodi."

msgctxt "#32253"
msgid "Items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Item yang ditonton di Kodi tanpa pemutaran di Trakt ditambahkan ke riwayatnya. Kodi tidak diubah."

msgctxt "#32254"
msgid "Each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Setiap sisi mendapatkan pemutaran yang belum dimilikinya, dan tidak ada yang ditandai belum ditonton di luar tonton ulang Trakt."

msgctxt "#32255"
msgid "Ratings aren't synced."
msgstr "Rating tidak disinkronkan."

msgctxt "#32256"
msgid "Kodi's ratings match Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi."
msgstr "Rating Kodi mengikuti Trakt, dan rating yang tidak ada di Trakt dihapus di Kodi."

msgctxt "#32257"
msgid "Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Rating Kodi ditambahkan ke Trakt, menggantikan rating yang berbeda. Kodi tidak diubah."

msgctxt "#32258"
msgid "Missing ratings are copied each way. Where they differ, Trakt's rating is kept."
msgstr "Rating yang hilang disalin ke kedua arah. Jika berbeda, rating Trakt dipertahankan."

msgctxt "#32259"
msgid "Kodi keeps its own resume points."
msgstr "Kodi mempertahankan titik lanjutnya sendiri."

msgctxt "#32260"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device."
msgstr "Kodi melanjutkan dari posisi item dijeda di Trakt, misalnya dari perangkat lain."

msgctxt "#32261"
msgid "A sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Sinkronisasi hanya berjalan saat Anda memulainya, misalnya dari menu konteks."

msgctxt "#32262"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean."
msgstr "Sinkronisasi berjalan saat Kodi selesai memindai atau membersihkan pustaka."

msgctxt "#32263"
msgid "Save and sync"
msgstr "Simpan dan sinkronkan"

msgctxt "#32264"
msgid "Unwatch %i items in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Tandai %i item sebagai belum ditonton di Kodi agar sesuai dengan Trakt?"

msgctxt "#32265"
msgid "Clear %i ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Hapus %i rating di Kodi agar sesuai dengan Trakt?"
